IP assignments were temporary/non-persistent and fully superseded, and cleanup removed backup/script artifacts, though generated root API keys were left in place on both firewalls.","limitations":["The provider-wide restart protocol is assessed only as supplemental evidence quality, not as part of the public task contract, per instructions.","Root API keys created for IPsec configuration were not explicitly revoked after use; no evidence was captured on whether this is standard practice for this environment."]},"ttft_ms":17999,"type":"result","duration_ms":75266,"uuid":"dd63da98-1074-4a19-b67f-8ea13fd0810c","ttft_stream_ms":1716,"time_to_request_ms":107,"first_content_frame_ms":2086,"queued_turn_count":0}
